WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.660
England does not look so different from Scotland. Aye, they are sisters.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:21.629
Queen Elizabeth, your cousin Mary has returned to take up her throne in Scotland. The Queen!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.870
My dear cousin Elizabeth,

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:31.639
I hope we might meet in person because I might embrace you but ruling side-by-side we must do so in

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:32.510
harmony

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.740
Not through a treaty drafted by men lesser than ourselves

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:42.280
My dear cousin let our nations cherish each other as we would. Two kingdoms united

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.420
How did the world come to this?... wise men servicing the whims of women?

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.770
Mary is our foe

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:55.980
We must never bow to her as we bow before you. You have the boldness to doubt my judgment!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.620
She is only your queen if I should not produce an heir

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.289
What is it like? To have a man

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.159
With heaven's blessing

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:11.899
We bring an heir to Scotland and to England

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.140
It is a clear provocation.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.800
We must make war in Scotland. So put your skills to use

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:25.350
Do not play into their hands. Our hatred is precisely what they hope for

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:30.089
I know your heart has more within it than the men who council you. You would do well to watch your words

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.080
I will not be scolded by my inferior

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.630
your inferior?...

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.620
Are you afraid, Henry?

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.969
No. Good, because our swords are not just for show

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.440
We have a scourge upon our land

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.440
There's a woman with a crown

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:10.380
Your beauty, your bravery... now I see there is no cause for envy

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.000
Your gifts will be your downfall

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:24.620
Should you murder me, remember you murder your sister and you murder your Queen.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.500
 

